bb:visual-discrimination-task a sosa:Procedure ;
    rdfs:label "Two-choice touch-screen visual discrimination, nose-poke initiated, FR1 reward on S+ touch" ;
    rdfs:comment "S+ pattern 3 on the rewarded screen, S- pattern 7 on the other; the rewarded side is fixed per animal and reversed after criterion (day 5 shown)." .

